[metadata]
Name:Rules pilot 258 - The Moon comes later
Goal:Survive
Turns:1
Difficulty:Medium
Description:You control Prismatic Omen, a Mountain and four Simic Guildgates, and have Blood Moon and Accumulated Knowledge in hand. End the turn with Blood Moon on the battlefield and Accumulated Knowledge in your graveyard.
Rule:rulesguru-c8f757e8da65af7a | Blood Moon and Prismatic Omen are not dependent on each other (CR 613.8a), so they apply in timestamp order (CR 613.7): a Blood Moon cast after the Omen makes the Guildgates only Mountains, so the blue spell must be cast before the Moon
